V004 ATTEMPT FACTS

Remote setup attempt 1 failed before creating the run directory. Shell quoting
left the remote run_root empty; mkdir reported permission denied for
`/candidate`, `/parent`, and `/results`, and the following scp reported that
the Candidate destination did not exist. No existing directory was changed.
Retry with a remotely single-quoted command created the previously absent
V004/e833b161 directory and uploaded the Candidate successfully.

Device extraction attempt 1 exported the linked `.aicore_binary` and `.text`
sections, then stopped with `environment: line 15: $1: unbound variable`
because the nm symbol column was selected incorrectly. No build or source
input changed. The extractor was corrected to select the fourth nm column and
successfully saved all six function extracts and target disassembly.

The first multi-file scp included `codegen-v004.txt`, which was generated on
the local workstation and therefore absent from the remote results directory.
scp reported that path as missing. All required artifacts were present locally
after transfer and are retained under this V004 results directory.
